      "text": [
        " اللَّهِ تَعَالَى سَأَلَ سائِلٌ بِعَذابٍ واقِعٍ. لِلْكافِرينَ بِوَلَايَةِ عَلِيٍّ لَيْسَ لَهُ دافِعٌ ثُمَّ قَالَ هَكَذَا وَ اللَّهِ نَزَلَ بِهَا جَبْرَئِيلُ ( عليه السلام ) عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Muhammad Bin Khalid, from Muhammad Bin Suleyman, from his father, from Abu Baseer, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> regarding the Words of Allah<sup>azwj</sup> the Exalted <span class=\"ibTxt\"><a href=\"/#/books/quran:70#h1\"><a href=\"/books/quran:70#h1\">[70:1]</a></a> A questioner, asked for the Punishment to befall <a href=\"/#/books/quran:70#h2\"><a href=\"/books/quran:70#h2\">[70:2]</a></a> For the unbelievers in the Wilayah of Ali</span><sup class=\"ibTxt\">asws</sup><span class=\"ibTxt\">, there is none to avert it</span>’. Then he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘<span style=\"text-decoration: underline\">This is how, by Allah</span><sup style=\"text-decoration: underline\">azwj</sup><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"> Jibraeel</span><sup style=\"text-decoration: underline\">as</sup><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"> descended with it unto Muhammad</span><sup style=\"text-decoration: underline\">saww</sup>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          " 47. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn ‘Isa from al-Hassan ibn Sayf from his brother from his father from abu Hamza from abu Ja‘far (a.s.) about the words of Allah, the Most High. “. . your ideas are confused <a href=\"/#/books/quran:51#h8\"><a href=\"/books/quran:51#h8\">[51:8]</a></a>. Let whoever wishes, turn away from it (Wilaya, Leadership with Divine Authority) (Our Quran).” <a href=\"/#/books/quran:51#h9\"><a href=\"/books/quran:51#h9\">[51:9]</a></a> The Imam (a.s.) said, “whoever would turn away from Wilaya, (Leadership with Divine Authority) he has turned away from paradise.”"
        ]
      }
